@startuml AppleNotesContext
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #E1F5FE
    BorderColor #01579B
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #E65100
}

actor User as "End User"
entity EmailService as "Email Service\n(Future: Password Reset)"
database PostgreSQL as "PostgreSQL\nDatabase"

rectangle "Apple Notes System" as System {
    component Frontend as "Next.js Frontend\n(React + TypeScript)"
    component Backend as "FastAPI Backend\n(Python + SQLAlchemy)"
}

User --> Frontend : Uses Web UI
Frontend --> Backend : HTTP/REST (JSON)
Backend --> PostgreSQL : SQL Queries
Backend -.-> EmailService : (Future Phase 2+)

note bottom of System
    Phase 1 MVP: Single-user, no external integrations
    Scope: Authentication, CRUD, Search, Organization
    Out of scope: iCloud sync, Rich text, Collaboration
end note

note right of Frontend
    - Note editor (create/edit/delete)
    - Folder tree navigation
    - Search interface
    - Auto-save indicator
end note

note right of Backend
    - Authentication (JWT)
    - Note/Folder/User services
    - Full-text search
    - Auto-save logic (3-sec debounce)
end note

@enduml
